Just like in any hub-and spoke-architecture, the bulk of the TRN nodes (residing in tiers 1 and 3) communicate with the motif hubs. This minimizes the number of links, making the TRNs extremely sparse (i.e. having extremely low graph density D) as shown in Table 1. The motif hubs colored blue demonstrate particularly high role \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
